      },
      {
        "heading": "Which industries and vendors dominate Maryland federal contracting?",
        "body": "Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) leads with $2.8B in obligations. Engineering Services has $2.7B and Computer Systems Design Services has $2.6B. THE JOHNS HOPKINS UNIVERSITY APPLIED PHYSICS LABORATORY LLC is the top vendor with $1.4B, followed by ORANO FEDERAL SERVICES LLC and AMERICAN CENTRIFUGE OPERATING, LLC at $900M each."
